192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (Greater scrutiny of competition in cloud and AI markets follows from the same concerns, which is why the European Commission is right to pay closer attention to both. Regulators have made clear that they want these markets to become fairer and more open to competition, and that goal deserves support. Any serious effort to build trustworthy AI has to reach the infrastructure layer, because that is where dependence takes hold and switching costs become severe. A market in which a few firms control the compute, cloud, partnership networks, and compliance pathway will struggle to discipline concentrated power and will more likely entrench it. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5 246 0 R 7]
>>
endobj
